{"project":{"startingElement":"76724a0b-9935-4c27-9941-90c63f3a795c","boards":{"b031a811-813e-45a6-8d7f-30c0e4e46eac":{"name":"01 \u00b7 World event flows","notes":["6c069694-7fea-4980-b59d-d9dc2c857cc4","e1d06b05-73ac-4040-97d1-04a6f8091204","b7583d4b-fa40-4507-9057-7d2538281cc6","63297b78-e94e-4676-9e36-7dbdb9b02061","567ce162-983d-43ba-b0d6-409dce845e18","0bb7461c-3c0e-4337-8000-ef8c544dfd29","8a1702ae-b5fe-44cb-bacd-97868065a17c"],"jumpers":[],"branches":["e110b153-2cfa-4294-adcc-e4b14cd0aef3","270da112-6a6e-466e-b090-d0c0bb7c74ee","fabbd4d2-3d23-41de-b66a-7f819fe7723e","5a5c96ae-ef6f-421e-b2da-efca55bc5bc3"],"customId":"restore_power_quest","elements":["e60800d3-a5aa-49c4-9b9c-fb5f8c1c09e7","53a8e27d-542d-4222-85fc-36073d0e37df","bfc100c0-7b99-4404-a71c-c1b42b102c02","10be7825-974e-4306-b8e4-d2bbc63486dd","05d919db-a991-45b7-b20f-db02dbd6f307","76724a0b-9935-4c27-9941-90c63f3a795c","ebdc3d2e-5680-4b07-831c-fa919ef56da2","df460871-e5db-4974-87f8-1b071d5039e6","35f2414d-8156-474e-98d3-eaf74211d45b","802dcbdf-3cf6-4f75-8cbc-f8f03053f85e","6af8cc14-6034-4e97-ab3f-6ebbdc207161","f2d75b83-f348-4b58-8190-b68d119db86d","2689f5bc-f257-4b93-8d03-16760617ef62","41df4d86-d079-4785-a22a-013597633640","c80115f9-8323-42c8-b514-6d7895ad6852","f0fd0f64-ef53-446f-a43b-63746394bba0","469d524b-9a3e-41b4-9f94-67a17246b608","988b8226-23eb-4990-b481-19cd7cd3145c","12c92fd1-be9a-40c9-9bc3-1d6f5573ee9a","961efa28-f033-44aa-ae8f-25bcb9a8e3e1"],"attributes":null,"connections":["d1857eb2-d333-4106-a851-f9f57f3c7a18","9670de6b-0cd3-4e0e-9e2c-05497b6ea6a8","35020249-1368-47c3-a8ca-358dce19746d","125db735-28b7-4f4c-9ff1-f3d61a086977","445828a6-f158-4e76-bbb1-34351ca30e48","3c3ab1e7-4dc5-473e-9c75-c436ead68314","7cfc50ee-e91b-4134-b4b3-e1c7fe49418e","5ccb6af8-2cd3-4061-9443-8fe6c31e23e9","728a4dc4-33d6-44fa-8dc1-f4e2839ddeff","7f315855-0c73-4087-bf3e-adbebfa82eae","e7253f89-1829-4d47-a08b-30ea13c87b1d","5491040d-2070-41f1-87d0-f50380a0560a","e47e38aa-d0f1-42b8-9434-9156e121730a","cf1cba2c-37e7-445e-be8d-8074e4ee251a","001db9e3-0994-414e-aa9d-f0d8df03efd1","bad0e004-b1c5-497f-89b0-f18585d4e881","d615dd01-51af-4054-a2e6-0150e6f7b06e","a2305253-4007-482c-8181-dcc093f75d48"]},"a9ad17ae-15e4-49b7-aff7-7df07bc1f5a2":{"connections":["9c12295b-eedf-4ffc-88e3-14d3b68db577","7416b596-f74d-4ee4-92ed-5faa59f94ced","cc38c1c6-ac22-4f84-9b6a-504c9f229da3","ded4ebaf-f02c-42e7-ba16-51f3605afe1e","616ab008-c762-4ae5-b5b5-9dc42ce4c307","634f7d62-b92c-4017-8611-2f775a54ff05"],"elements":["7be79d97-39d8-4179-ad71-4b60b4ee62c8","13031eea-0fa8-4721-ac16-8a583906a6ae","09438fc8-be1d-4f8a-adad-30170999ca60","172fb20d-be4b-40f7-acec-fb22e76afe50","825244f4-6345-4314-b731-1f378ae010a1","b87fd479-2ae1-4201-aaae-a738b8b53f99"],"jumpers":[],"name":"02 \u00b7 Objectives and interface","branches":["3cd93c4b-0dbb-47b0-9335-f36e3a27af08"],"customId":"quest_presentation","notes":["617a47ca-5627-4dd4-a761-e4e9436af53c"]}},"notes":{"6c069694-7fea-4980-b59d-d9dc2c857cc4":{"x":8500,"y":6800,"theme":"purple","width":3500,"height":310,"content":"<p><strong>WORLD EVENTS \u00b7 read each lane from left to right<\/strong><\/p><p>Unreal calls an entry point when the corresponding world event occurs. Connections inside a lane run automatically; unconnected lanes wait for their own event. Initialization never accepts the task.<\/p><p>Five global quest variables have distinct owners: questStarted and questCompleted are narrative milestones; powerRestored records the generator state; powerCells is the number of unique pickups collected by Unreal; requiredPowerCells is the authored target. The standalone UI component holds twelve scoped string attributes for shared interface labels, such as ui.station_name. There are seventeen runtime variables in total.<\/p><p>The collect_cell component requests a physical pickup. Unreal records that pickup, updates powerCells, and then follows the connection to the feedback element. restore_power and open_gate are registered C++ world actions. Completing the generator does not complete the quest: the player must enter the exit.<\/p><p>The Objectives and interface board chooses a cached display after each event. HUD drawing and focus queries only read that cache.<\/p>","autoHeight":true},"e1d06b05-73ac-4040-97d1-04a6f8091204":{"y":7560,"x":8700,"autoHeight":true,"height":140,"theme":"purple","content":"<p><strong>INITIALIZE<\/strong><\/p><p>Called once after importing fresh project defaults. Ends with arrival feedback; no automatic terminal interaction.<\/p>","width":1800},"b7583d4b-fa40-4507-9057-7d2538281cc6":{"y":8200,"x":8700,"autoHeight":true,"height":140,"theme":"purple","content":"<p><strong>TERMINAL EVENT<\/strong><\/p><p>The terminal accepts the task once, then responds to accepted, powered, or completed state.<\/p>","width":1800},"63297b78-e94e-4676-9e36-7dbdb9b02061":{"y":10100,"x":8700,"autoHeight":true,"height":140,"theme":"purple","content":"<p><strong>GENERATOR EVENT<\/strong><\/p><p>Check already-powered state first, then task acceptance, then the authored cell requirement. Success opens the gate; it does not finish the quest.<\/p>","width":1800},"567ce162-983d-43ba-b0d6-409dce845e18":{"y":11900,"x":8700,"autoHeight":true,"height":140,"theme":"purple","content":"<p><strong>PICKUP EVENT<\/strong><\/p><p>Narrative permission precedes the collect_cell world action. Render feedback only after Unreal updates powerCells.<\/p>","width":1800},"0bb7461c-3c0e-4337-8000-ef8c544dfd29":{"y":13050,"x":8700,"autoHeight":true,"height":140,"theme":"purple","content":"<p><strong>PHYSICAL DUPLICATE EVENT<\/strong><\/p><p>Unreal detects an already-collected world actor and executes this feedback directly. This physical fact needs no extra story variable.<\/p>","width":1800},"8a1702ae-b5fe-44cb-bacd-97868065a17c":{"y":13780,"x":8700,"autoHeight":true,"height":140,"theme":"purple","content":"<p><strong>EXIT EVENT<\/strong><\/p><p>Called by the exit overlap. Only a powered exit can set questCompleted; repeated overlaps produce feedback without repeating completion.<\/p>","width":1800},"617a47ca-5627-4dd4-a761-e4e9436af53c":{"y":8850,"x":8700,"autoHeight":true,"height":240,"theme":"purple","content":"<p><strong>OBJECTIVE AND INTERACTION DISPLAY<\/strong><\/p><p>After initialization or any world event, evaluate this branch once and cache the selected leaf. Its content is the objective; its seven named plain-text attributes supply the mission heading, grid state, prompts, and world labels.<\/p><p>These leaves only show text. They never assign state or dispatch command components. Shared labels live in the standalone UI component (custom ID ui). Its twelve plain string attributes have stable custom IDs, such as ui.station_name. Unreal refreshes these labels from current variable values after each event. The component is not a gameplay command.<\/p>","width":2300}},"elements":{"10be7825-974e-4306-b8e4-d2bbc63486dd":{"x":10600,"y":11360,"theme":"orange","width":360,"height":170,"outputs":[],"autoHeight":true,"components":[],"content":"<pre><code>show(\"The generator needs \", requiredPowerCells, \" power cells. You have \", powerCells, \". Collect the missing cells, then try again.\")<\/code><\/pre>","title":"<p>02b \u00b7 More cells needed<\/p>"},"53a8e27d-542d-4222-85fc-36073d0e37df":{"x":9000,"y":11200,"theme":"gold","width":360,"height":170,"outputs":["d1857eb2-d333-4106-a851-f9f57f3c7a18"],"autoHeight":true,"components":[],"content":"<p>Checking the generator...<\/p><pre><code>show(\"Power cells collected: \", powerCells, \"\/\", requiredPowerCells)<\/code><\/pre>","title":"<p>02 \u00b7 Check the generator<\/p>"},"bfc100c0-7b99-4404-a71c-c1b42b102c02":{"x":10600,"y":11060,"theme":"green","width":360,"height":170,"outputs":[],"autoHeight":true,"components":["defba3c3-cdce-4b80-91cc-b75118f1f512","80c7c42c-bb19-4065-8afa-7cd5b54776fc"],"content":"<pre><code>powerRestored = true<\/code><\/pre><p><strong>Power restored.<\/strong> The lights come on and the exit gate opens. Reach the illuminated exit to complete your escape.<\/p>","title":"<p>03 \u00b7 Power restored<\/p>"},"e60800d3-a5aa-49c4-9b9c-fb5f8c1c09e7":{"x":10600,"y":9440,"theme":"cyan","width":360,"height":170,"outputs":[],"autoHeight":true,"components":[],"content":"<pre><code>questStarted = true<\/code><\/pre><pre><code>show(\"The outpost is dark. Collect \", requiredPowerCells, \" power cells, then use the generator to restore the lights and open the exit gate.\")<\/code><\/pre><p>You can try the generator before collecting all required cells.<\/p>","title":"<p>01 \u00b7 Restore power<\/p>"},"05d919db-a991-45b7-b20f-db02dbd6f307":{"width":360,"y":10760,"x":10600,"height":170,"theme":"purple","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>Use the terminal to accept the task first.<\/p><p>The generator is waiting for authorization. Return here after accepting the restore-power task.<\/p>","title":"<p>02a \u00b7 Accept the task first<\/p>"},"76724a0b-9935-4c27-9941-90c63f3a795c":{"width":370,"y":7900,"x":9000,"height":150,"theme":"cyan","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>The gate has no power. Use the terminal to begin.<\/p>","title":"<p>Initialize \u00b7 station arrival<\/p>"},"ebdc3d2e-5680-4b07-831c-fa919ef56da2":{"width":370,"y":9000,"x":9000,"height":150,"theme":"cyan","autoHeight":true,"outputs":["728a4dc4-33d6-44fa-8dc1-f4e2839ddeff"],"content":"<p>Accessing station terminal\u2026<\/p>","title":"<p>Event \u00b7 use terminal<\/p>"},"df460871-e5db-4974-87f8-1b071d5039e6":{"width":370,"y":12500,"x":9000,"height":150,"theme":"cyan","autoHeight":true,"outputs":["e47e38aa-d0f1-42b8-9434-9156e121730a"],"content":"<p>Checking power cell\u2026<\/p>","title":"<p>Event \u00b7 collect a power cell<\/p>"},"35f2414d-8156-474e-98d3-eaf74211d45b":{"width":370,"y":13300,"x":9000,"height":150,"theme":"orange","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>This power cell has already been collected.<\/p>","title":"<p>Physical duplicate \u00b7 already collected<\/p>"},"802dcbdf-3cf6-4f75-8cbc-f8f03053f85e":{"width":370,"y":14600,"x":9000,"height":150,"theme":"cyan","autoHeight":true,"outputs":["a2305253-4007-482c-8181-dcc093f75d48"],"content":"<p>Checking exit authorization\u2026<\/p>","title":"<p>Event \u00b7 enter the exit<\/p>"},"7be79d97-39d8-4179-ad71-4b60b4ee62c8":{"width":370,"y":10000,"x":9000,"height":150,"theme":"cyan","autoHeight":true,"outputs":["634f7d62-b92c-4017-8611-2f775a54ff05"],"content":"<p>Refreshing objective display.<\/p>","title":"<p>Refresh \u00b7 objective and prompts<\/p>"},"b87fd479-2ae1-4201-aaae-a738b8b53f99":{"width":430,"y":10800,"x":10600,"height":180,"theme":"gold","autoHeight":true,"attributes":["83336380-d9c2-436b-a174-a6b68d8a2cf3","efa2b6f8-16e9-4196-bab0-8afc3ce80927","76f62246-4f25-4266-865c-1fa70b4b88a5","a88fc2a3-90e4-42d5-8ac0-c6efe39c04ec","e2a88b28-3fab-4777-994a-d3393c6536a4","04df9e54-02be-42cb-8586-b7286858daa1","b0bbac5a-6de6-47e7-8e5f-4b7aff1601e0"],"content":"<p>Return to the generator and restore power.<\/p>","title":"<p>Display \u00b7 ready<\/p>"},"6af8cc14-6034-4e97-ab3f-6ebbdc207161":{"width":370,"y":12620,"x":11300,"height":150,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"content":"<pre><code>show(\"Collected a power cell (\", powerCells, \"\/\", requiredPowerCells, \").\")<\/code><\/pre>","title":"<p>Pickup accepted \u00b7 updated inventory<\/p>"},"f2d75b83-f348-4b58-8190-b68d119db86d":{"width":370,"y":14600,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"content":"<pre><code>questCompleted = true<\/code><\/pre><p>You reached the exit. Task complete.<\/p>","title":"<p>Exit reached \u00b7 task complete<\/p>"},"2689f5bc-f257-4b93-8d03-16760617ef62":{"width":370,"y":9140,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"cyan","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>The terminal's task has already been accepted. Continue restoring power to the station.<\/p>","title":"<p>Terminal \u00b7 task already accepted<\/p>"},"41df4d86-d079-4785-a22a-013597633640":{"width":370,"y":8840,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>Power is restored and the gate is open. Walk through the exit to complete the task.<\/p>","title":"<p>Terminal \u00b7 exit is ready<\/p>"},"c80115f9-8323-42c8-b514-6d7895ad6852":{"width":370,"y":8540,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>The terminal confirms the task is complete.<\/p>","title":"<p>Terminal \u00b7 task already complete<\/p>"},"f0fd0f64-ef53-446f-a43b-63746394bba0":{"width":370,"y":10460,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>The generator is already running and the gate is open.<\/p>","title":"<p>Generator \u00b7 already online<\/p>"},"469d524b-9a3e-41b4-9f94-67a17246b608":{"width":370,"y":12320,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"purple","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>Use the terminal to accept the task first.<\/p>","title":"<p>Pickup denied \u00b7 accept the task<\/p>"},"988b8226-23eb-4990-b481-19cd7cd3145c":{"width":370,"y":12620,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"gold","autoHeight":true,"components":["06f4de3e-a022-472e-a2f9-bd73ee5875ee"],"outputs":["cf1cba2c-37e7-445e-be8d-8074e4ee251a"],"content":"<p>Collecting the power cell\u2026<\/p>","title":"<p>World action \u00b7 collect the focused cell<\/p>"},"12c92fd1-be9a-40c9-9bc3-1d6f5573ee9a":{"width":370,"y":14900,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"orange","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>The exit has no power. Restore power at the generator first.<\/p>","title":"<p>Exit denied \u00b7 restore power<\/p>"},"961efa28-f033-44aa-ae8f-25bcb9a8e3e1":{"width":370,"y":14300,"x":10600,"height":150,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"content":"<p>You have already reached the exit. The task is complete.<\/p>","title":"<p>Exit \u00b7 already complete<\/p>"},"13031eea-0fa8-4721-ac16-8a583906a6ae":{"width":430,"y":9400,"x":10600,"height":180,"theme":"green","autoHeight":true,"attributes":["5cc9f9eb-97a2-4508-a0e8-561ec4ffb9a8","3af8d3ed-4aa4-4158-a7a8-2afe338961fe","fbdb0b7b-6e33-4deb-93e9-c2438eb3e48c","050ac5e9-7840-452c-a0de-e916ad66cb70","16629913-447e-4046-bc53-851123b8bc51","d8e7067f-237